{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45429","headline":"贺幸普济寺应制 · 广宣","name":"贺幸普济寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南方宝界几由旬，八部同瞻一佛身。\n寺压山河天宇静，楼悬日月镜光新。\n重城柳暗东风曙，复道花明上苑春。\n向晚銮舆归凤阙，曲江池上动青苹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}